  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">🎈 שִׂיחָה בְּסְמָלִים – רִיב רוֹעֵי אַבְרָהָם וְלוֹט</span></span></h2><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐑 <b>רוֹעֵי אַבְרָהָם</b> (בַּעֲדִינוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"אֲנַחְנוּ סָגַרְנוּ אֶת פִּי הַבְּהֵמוֹת, כְּדֵי שֶׁלֹּא יִגְזְלוּ אֶת העֵשֶׂב מֵהַשָּׂדוֹת שֶׁל אֲנָשִׁים אֲחֵרִים.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌱 <b>הָאָרֶץ</b> (בִּלְחִישָׁה רַכָּה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"צוֹדְקִים. ה' הִבְטִיחַ לָתֵת אוֹתִי לְאַבְרָהָם - אֲבָל רַק בֶּעָתִיד. בֵּינְתַיִם אֲנִי שַׁיֶּכֶת לָעָם הַכְּנַעֲנִי.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐐 <b>רוֹעֵי לוֹט</b> (מִתְלוֹנְנִים):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לָמָּה לִמְנוֹעַ אֶת הַמִּרְעֶה? <br />הָאָרֶץ הוּבְטְחָה לַאֲדֹנֵינוּ אַבְרָהָם, וְלוֹט יִזְכֶּה בָּהּ לְאַחַר מוֹת אַבְרָהָם בְּלִי בָּנִים!\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔥 <b>הַמְּרִיבָה</b> (מִתְלַקַּחַת כְּאֵשׁ):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"אָנוּ הצוֹדְקִים!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא נָכוֹן – אֲנַחְנוּ!<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָאָרֶץ מִתְמַלֵּאת קוֹלוֹת כּוֹעֲסִים.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">❤️ <b>אַבְרָהָם</b> (בְּלֵב גָּדוֹל וְרָגוּעַ):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"אֲנִי וְאַתָּה – אֲחִים אֲנַחְנוּ. אַל נָא תְּהִי מְרִיבָה בֵּינֵינוּ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָבָה נִפָּרֵד בְּשָׁלוֹם:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם אַתָּה תֵּלֵךְ לַיָּמִין – אֲנִי אֵלֵךְ לְצַד שְׂמֹאל.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם אַתָּה תִּבְחַר בַּשְּׂמֹאל - אֵלֵךְ אֲנִי לַיָּמִין.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👦 <b>לוֹט</b> (מַבִּיט לְכִכַּר הַיַּרְדֵּן):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"תִּרְאוּ! כֻּלָּהּ מַשְׁקֶה! הַכֹּל שָׁם פּוֹרֵחַ כְּגַן ה'.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שָׁם אֵשֶׁב לִי – בִּסְדוֹם.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🏙️ <b>סְדוֹם</b> (בְּקוֹל מְפַתֶּה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"בּוֹא אֵלַי, לוֹט. אֶצְלִי בָּתֵּי אֶבֶן, שְׁוָקִים בְּשֶׁפַע.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא חָסֵר כְּלוּם, רַק ... מַעֲשַׂי רָעִים לִפְנֵי ה'.\"</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✨ <b>הַתּוֹרָה</b> (מְגַלָּה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לוֹט הִתְרַחֵק מֵאַבְרָהָם הַצַּדִּיק, וּבָחַר לָגוּר בִּסְדוֹם הָרָעָה...</span></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מלכותית</span></span></h2></div><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את 🔍 המלכים שנלחמו: אַמְרָפֶל, אַרְיוֹךְ, כְּדָרְלָעֹמֶר, תִדְעָל, בֶּרַע, בִּרְשַׁע,&nbsp; שִׁנְאָב.</span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></span></div><br style=\"background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\" /><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/b3765726b10b20f884.png\" style=\"background-color: initial; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"456\" data-original-width=\"467\" height=\"312\" src=\"/assets/images/content/b3765726b10b20f884.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></span></h2><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></span></h2></span></div></div><p data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"93\" style=\"display: inline;\"></p><li style=\"display: inline; text-align: right;\"></li><p></p><p data-end=\"204\" data-start=\"126\"></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><p data-end=\"334\" data-start=\"286\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' צִוָּה אֶת אַבְרָם: \"לֶךְ־לְךָ מֵאַרְצְךָ\".</span></p></li><li data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"335\"><p data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"338\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַבְרָם הָיָה בֶּן 85 שָׁנָה כְּשֶׁיָּצָא מֵחָרָן.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"391\"><p data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"394\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹט, בֶּן אָחִיו שֶׁל אַבְרָם, הָלַךְ אִתּוֹ.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"503\"><p data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"506\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָיְתָה מְרִיבָה בֵּין רֹעֵי אַבְרָם וְרוֹעֵי לוֹט.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"615\"><p data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"618\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹט בָּחַר לָשֶׁבֶת בְּחֶבְרוֹן.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"719\"><p data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"722\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַנְשֵׁי סְדוֹם הָיוּ&nbsp;טוֹבִים וּנְעִימִים.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"780\"><p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"784\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַרְבָּעָה מְלָכִים נִלְחֲמוּ בַּחֲמִשָּׁה מְלָכִים.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"893\"><p data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"897\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹט נִלְכַּד בַּמִּלְחָמָה וְנִשְׁבָּה.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"940\"><p data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"944\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַבְרָם פָּחַד&nbsp;לִּרְדֹּף אַחֲרֵי הַמְּלָכִים.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"995\"><p data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"999\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַלְכִּי־צֶדֶק מֶלֶךְ שָׁלֵם הוֹצִיא לֶחֶם וָיָיִן.</span></p></li></ol>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
}
